look glass
# NOTE: click on layer surfaces may not register in the harness
ipc panels open spotlight IRICE-TEST
wait 1
key fi
wait 1
shot rr-fi
note App rows have their Colloid coloured icons at x 10, 26 px (Thunar blue folder, Foot in colour); earlier Rust drew dark monochrome glyphs (FAIL: fixed by iconStyle default). List any row with an empty icon slot and its app name.
ptr move 960 350 sleep 300 glide 960 350 300
wait 1
shot rr-hover
note Unselected row under the pointer has its hover fill at once.
ptr move 960 350 sleep 100 glide 960 800 300
wait 1
shot rr-hover-off
note Fill cleared after the pointer left the row.
key -M ctrl -k a -m ctrl
key -k BackSpace
key :smile
wait 1
shot rr-emoji
note Emoji rows with the emoji at 20 px centred in the leading slot; same as QML.
# MANUAL: /.bash file rows (no files in the sandbox): hover a file row -> eye at the right, glide onto the eye keeps the row hovered, click opens Quick Look
# row click runs the app and closes Search
key -M ctrl -k a -m ctrl
key -k BackSpace
key fi
wait 1
ptr move 960 310 sleep 200 click
wait 2
shot rr-click
note Click on the first row starts the app and Search is closed (if click does not register on layer surfaces in the harness, note that).
setup pkill -x foot || true
